<script setup lang="ts">import {computed} from 'vue';import {fmt,percent} from '../utils/format';const p=defineProps<{bootstrap:any}>();const max=computed(()=>Math.max(...p.bootstrap.histogram.counts,1));</script><template><section class="bootstrap-strip"><div class="section-head"><h2>整试样重采样，保留退化重复。</h2><span>{{bootstrap.valid_repeats}} / {{bootstrap.requested_repeats}} 有效 · {{percent(bootstrap.valid_fraction)}}</span></div><p>每次有放回抽取完整试样计数行，固定原三人面板；不按单票抽样，不代表新标记者的不确定性。</p><svg viewBox="0 0 900 205" role="img" aria-label="有效bootstrap κ频数分布"><line x1="35" y1="160" x2="870" y2="160" class="hist-axis"/><g v-for="(count,i) in bootstrap.histogram.counts" :key="i"><rect :x="35+Number(i)*41.75+3" :y="160-Number(count)/max*125" width="35" :height="Number(count)/max*125" class="hist-bar"/><text v-if="count" :x="35+Number(i)*41.75+20" :y="151-Number(count)/max*125" text-anchor="middle">{{count}}</text></g><text x="35" y="190">κ −1</text><text x="452" y="190" text-anchor="middle">0</text><text x="870" y="190" text-anchor="end">1</text></svg><div class="interval-line"><div><small>95%经验percentile区间</small><strong v-if="bootstrap.interval">[{{fmt(bootstrap.interval[0],6)}}, {{fmt(bootstrap.interval[1],6)}}]</strong><strong v-else>暂不报告</strong></div><p>{{bootstrap.interval_reason}}。退化 {{bootstrap.invalid_repeats}} 次，未补抽替换。</p></div><p v-for="(count,reason) in bootstrap.invalid_reasons" :key="reason" class="invalid-reason">{{reason}}：{{count}} 次</p><details><summary>前16次重复：行索引、κ和失败理由</summary><div class="replicate-line" v-for="r in bootstrap.replicates.slice(0,16)" :key="r.repeat"><strong>#{{r.repeat}} {{r.valid?fmt(r.kappa,6):'未定义'}}</strong><span>{{r.reason||'有效'}} / 抽取行 {{r.sample_indices.slice(0,12).join(', ')}}{{r.sample_indices.length>12?' …':''}}</span></div></details></section></template>
